  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/contributors/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"152\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/network/members\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/forks/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/stargazers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"96\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"142\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/blob/master/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinkedin.com%252fin%252fkit-lehto\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-LinkedIn-black.svg?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=linkedin&amp;colorB=555\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pbwnMwnUD6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1032138561618726952?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Discord\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu-badges-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/v/modmenu-badges-lib?label=Modrinth&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"182\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ModMenu 徽章庫</strong></h2><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">更多徽章！！！</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">關於專案<br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/33298273/233725872-902aa00e-618d-48d3-b594-990d2cad85ae.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"圖片\"></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>一個簡單的函式庫，用於在 ModMenu 中新增您自己的徽章。</p><p>例如，<a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tschipcraft</a> 在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/dynamiclights\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Lights</a> 中使用它來新增資料包徽章。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">設定</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">指南請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>完整的功能（及已知問題）列表請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/yet-another-cobble-gen/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">開啟的問題</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">貢獻</h3><p>貢獻使得開源社群成為一個如此美好的學習、啟發和創造的地方。您所做的任何貢獻都將受到 <strong>衷心感激</strong>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如果您有任何能讓此專案更好的建議，請複製（fork）此儲存庫並建立拉取請求（pull request）。您也可以直接建立一個帶有「enhancement」標籤的問題。別忘了給專案一顆星星！再次感謝！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ol>\n<li>複製（Fork）專案</li>\n<li>建立您的功能分支（<code>git checkout -b feature/AmazingFeature</code>）</li>\n<li>提交您的變更（<code>git commit -m 'Add some AmazingFeature'</code>）</li>\n<li>推送至分支（<code>git push origin feature/AmazingFeature</code>）</li>\n<li>開啟一個拉取請求（Pull Request）</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">授權許可</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">本專案採用 MIT 授權條款發布。詳細資訊請參閱 <strong><code>LICENSE.txt</code></strong>。</p>",
